WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.278
Delta tables add table behavior on top of data files
They use a transaction

00:00:06.305 --> 00:00:11.423
log to track table changes and support more reliable
operations than plain collections of files

00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:17.635
For this course the key idea is that Delta tables
make lakehouse data easier to

00:00:17.661 --> 00:00:19.201
query and manage as tables
